'''Volcanic Fury''' (風林火山, ''Fūrinkazan'', '''Wind, Forest, Fire, Mountain''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (M): Cannon gauge will be filled +4 steps/40% charged.

