==Trivia==
*Volcanic Fury's Japanese name, [[wikipedia:Fūrinkazan|Fūrinkazan]] (風林火山), is a phrase that was used on war banners by the warlord [[wikipedia:Takeda Shingen|Takeda Shingen]].

